      "description": "The largest siluriform catfish in Bangladesh rivers, reaching 2.4 m. Nicknamed the \"freshwater shark\" for its aggressive predatory behaviour and large, gaping mouth. Critically significant in local riverine ecosystems as an apex freshwater predator.",
